// The difficulty level "hard" against the static opponent (WP9.4a, docs/rules/ai.md "Difficulty levels (WP9.4a)"): player 0
// (Meridian) is the AI with a construction centre and 4000 credits on the first match's map (`assets/maps/m1`); player 1
// (Veyran) is the static opponent of `assets/matches/m1.ron`, which never builds, produces or attacks. No scripted command:
// everything player 0 does is the AI's, with the profile `hard.ron`: two builds at once, three harvesters per refinery, the shipped goal list, attacks by the clock after 9,000, escalation 250 / 8,000. It wins when the
// opponent's construction centre falls (docs/rules/match.md): it wins at tick 9,093, inside the 16,000 ticks.
//
// `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy (`ai_vs_passive_hard_defs`, the definitions of `ai_vs_passive_defs` of 12-11-2026, a match
// file of its own and a byte copy of the shipped `assets/ai/hard.ron` of WP9.4a). The definitions never move this checksum;
// the profile copy is tied to the shipped file by a test (`the_scenarios_play_the_shipped_profile_files`), so a change of
// `assets/ai/hard.ron` fails it until this scenario is re-pinned on purpose. The ore, harvest, storage, money, production,
// power and vision numbers are those of `ai_scout`.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_vs_passive_hard",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_vs_passive_hard_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "hard.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 16000,
    commands: [],
)
